 N">\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta name="Generator" content="Zap Calendar (http://
 zapcalendar.com)"/><title></title></head><body>\n<p></p><p>Ratified on Jan
 uary 23\, 1964\, this amendment abolishes the poll tax\, which originally 
 had been instituted in 11 southern states after Reconstruction to make it 
 difficult for poor blacks to vote.<br/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Brough
 t to you by <a href='http://americanhistorycalendar.com'>http://AmericanHi
 storyCalendar.com</a>.<br/>\nLike our Facebook page to see upcoming histor
 y events in your feed <a href='https://www.facebook.com/AmericanHistoryCal
 endar/'>https://www.facebook.com/AmericanHistoryCalendar/</a>.</p></body><
 /html>
DESCRIPTION:Ratified on January 23\, 1964\, this amendment abolishes the po
 ll tax\, which originally had been instituted in 11 southern states after 
 Reconstruction to make it difficult for poor blacks to vote.\n\n\n\nBrough
 t to you by http://AmericanHistoryCalendar.com.\nLike our Facebook page to
  see upcoming history events in your feed https://www.facebook.com/America
 nHistoryCalendar/.
URL:https://americanhistorycalendar.com/eventscalendar/2\,1983-the-24th-ame
 ndment-is-ratified-abolishes-poll-tax
END:VEVENT
