 77\, the Second Continental Congress adopted the U.S. flag.  In 1916\, Pre
 sident Woodrow Wilson officially declared June 14 as National Flag Day.<br
 />\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Brought to you by <a href='http://americanh
