 zapcalendar.com)"/><title></title></head><body>\n<p></p><p>January 27\, 19
 67<br/>\n<br/>\nThree NASA astronauts were killed from a flash fire while 
 onboard the command module during a launch pad test.  The tragedy brought 
 about changes in the Apollo program to improve safety.  The AS-204 mission
  was redesignated Apollo I in honor of the crew.<br/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><
 /p>\n<p>Brought to you by <a href='http://americanhistorycalendar.com'>htt
 p://AmericanHistoryCalendar.com</a>.<br/>\nLike our Facebook page to see u
 pcoming history events in your feed <a href='https://www.facebook.com/Amer
 icanHistoryCalendar/'>https://www.facebook.com/AmericanHistoryCalendar/</a
 >.</p></body></html>
DESCRIPTION:January 27\, 1967\n\nThree NASA astronauts were killed from a f
 lash fire while onboard the command module during a launch pad test.  The 
 tragedy brought about changes in the Apollo program to improve safety.  Th
 e AS-204 mission was redesignated Apollo I in honor of the crew.\n\n\n\nBr
 ought to you by http://AmericanHistoryCalendar.com.\nLike our Facebook pag
 e to see upcoming history events in your feed https://www.facebook.com/Ame
 ricanHistoryCalendar/.
URL:https://americanhistorycalendar.com/eventscalendar/2\,3263-three-astron
 auts-killed-from-flash-fire-while-onboard-command-module
END:VEVENT
